# Per-phase execution scaffolding stays out of git.
*
!.gitignore
# There was one exception here: `fastmcp-v4-reference.md`, un-ignored because
# `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-27-mcp-server.md` cited it three times and told its reader
# to read it first -- "a committed plan must not point at a file that is not in the
# repository." Both documents were pre-publication scratch and neither reached the published
# tree, so the exception protected a link nobody could follow and the comment asserting
# otherwise was false. The notes' substance -- their eight UNCERTAIN items and the measured
# answers -- now lives in `docs/superpowers/specs/ooxml-ledger-design.md` section 7.2, where
# every row re-runs as an assertion in `tests/test_fastmcp_contract.py`.
